customers.yaml reference.

Usage:
  invox help customers

Behavior:
  Shows the supported customers.yaml shape used by new, validate, render, build, and email.
  `invox customer edit` opens the resolved file for editing.

Formatting:
  Top-level customer IDs must start at column 1 with no leading spaces.

{{template "customer-fields"}}

Rules:
  Preferred display name path is <customer>.name; <customer>.legal_company_name is also accepted.
  Email lookup order is billing.send_invoice_to, billing.email, then email.
  email_greeting defaults to Hello, when omitted.
  billing.currency defaults to EUR.
  numbering.code feeds {customer_code}; numbering.start overrides config.numbering.start for one customer.

Lookup:
  customers.yaml: upward project search, then {{.Customers}}

Examples:
  invox help customers
  invox customer edit
  invox new CUST-001 -c customers.yaml

